Detector: divide-before-multiply
PeriodicAllocation.unlockFor(address) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_302_SC06.sol#726-744) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- periodsSinceUnlockStart = (now.sub(unlockStart)).div(shares[_owner].periodLength) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_302_SC06.sol#730)
	- share = share.div(shares[_owner].periods).mul(periodsSinceUnlockStart) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_302_SC06.sol#733)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

